  "title": "Park Dental Partners Announces Date for 2026 Annual Shareholders Meeting",
  "summary": "MINNEAPOLIS, Jan. 29, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Park Dental Partners, Inc. (NASDAQ: PARK), a leading dental resource organization, today announced that it will hold its annual shareholder meeting on Friday, May 29, 2026. The location and time of the meeting will be announced at a later date.",
